+    /// 줄의 줄간격(문단 끝 줄이면 문단 뒤 간격 포함) 중 최댓값이다. 셀 순서는
+    /// `row_stored_rewind_unit_indices` 와 같다.
+    pub(crate) fn row_cut_stored_ink_box(
+        &self,
+        table: &crate::model::table::Table,
+        row: usize,
+        end_cut: &[usize],
+        styles: &ResolvedStyleSet,
+    ) -> (f64, f64) {
+        let mut cells: Vec<&crate::model::table::Cell> = table
+            .cells
+            .iter()
+            .filter(|cell| cell.row as usize == row && cell.row_span == 1)
+            .collect();
+        cells.sort_by_key(|cell| cell.col);
+        cells
+            .iter()
+            .zip(end_cut)
+            .filter_map(|(cell, &end)| {
+                let units = self.cell_units(cell, table, styles);
+                let closing = units.get(end.checked_sub(1)?)?;
+                let para = cell.paragraphs.get(closing.para_idx)?;
+                let seg = para.line_segs.get(closing.vis_end.checked_sub(1)?)?;
+                let padding = cell.effective_padding(&table.padding);
+                let ink = hwpunit_to_px(
+                    i32::from(padding.top)
+                        + seg.vertical_pos.max(0)
+                        + seg.line_height.max(0)
+                        + i32::from(padding.bottom),
+                    self.dpi,
+                );
+                let after = if closing.vis_end == para.line_segs.len() {
+                    styles
+                        .para_styles
+                        .get(para.para_shape_id as usize)
+                        .map(|style| style.spacing_after)
+                        .unwrap_or(0.0)
+                } else {
+                    0.0
+                };
+                Some((
+                    ink,
+                    hwpunit_to_px(seg.line_spacing.max(0), self.dpi) + after,
+                ))
+            })
+            .fold((0.0, 0.0), |(ink, advance), (cell_ink, cell_advance)| {
+                (f64::max(ink, cell_ink), f64::max(advance, cell_advance))
+            })
+    }
